SUMMARY:DNA Doesn't Lie: True Crime & Family Mysteries
DESCRIPTION:Step into the world where science\, history\, and mystery collide. DNA Doesn’t Lie: True Crime & Family Mysteries is an immersive\, interactive true-crime experience led by Eric Schubert\, ES Genealogy\, the internationally recognized genealogist and genetic genealogist.\n\nDuring this two-hour event\, Eric will dive deeper into the rapidly evolving field of forensic genealogy — how DNA\, public databases\, and family trees can unravel decades-old mysteries. But this isn’t just a lecture. You become part of the investigation. Attendees will work together to analyze clues\, interpret genealogical patterns\, and attempt to crack a mystery crafted specifically for this event.\n\nWith only 36 tickets available\, this intimate session ensures every participant gets to participate and has the chance to ask questions directly to Eric. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/dna-doesnt-lie-true-crime-family-mysteries/
LOCATION:Southern Market\, 100 South Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/SMC2605_07-May-True-Crime-Event-WEB.avif
END:VEVENT
