SUMMARY:Bookish Beauty at Southern Market
DESCRIPTION:Join Princess Belle at Southern Market for a magical afternoon inspired by her love for reading and dreaming big. Children will enjoy a delightful reading by Princess Belle\, followed by singing\, dancing\, and photo opportunities with her.\n\nChildren are encouraged to dress as their favorite princess and will receive a goodie bag filled with a tiara and other royal treasures.\n\n*Parents enter for free. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
