SUMMARY:International Soccer Watch Party & Festival
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to feel the global energy right in the heart of Lancaster City!\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable evening celebrating global excitement at Lancaster’s Official International Soccer Watch Party and Festival!\n\nFrom the big match on screen to vibrant cultural performances\, international flavors\, and family-friendly activities\, this free event brings the community together for a night of soccer\, celebration\, and world-class fun. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
